<title>USA: Jos. A. Bank sets Leadbetter clothing line.</title>
<headline>Jos. A. Bank sets Leadbetter clothing line.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPSTEAD, Md. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Clothiers Inc said Friday it had entered into a relationship with David Leadbetter, a well known golf instructor, to produce a line of clothing bearing Leadbetter's name.</p>
<p>The clothing will be sold exclusively in Jos. A. Bank stores and catalog and will be offered in Europe and Japan as well, the company said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
